    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 143 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(How Will I Achieve My Dream?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "In order to become a teacher,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "my parents tell me that I need to study hard in all my subjects,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "so I must go to a good university."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "They also tell me that I need to love children and serve others."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I think teaching children is fun and rewarding,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and that I must have a lot of patience in order to teach them."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I know that one day I will be able to achieve my dream"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and help many children learn and grow."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
        "2 번",
        "3 번",
        "4 번",
        "5 번"
      ]
